.second);\n                    j++;\n                }\n                sets.add(new Pair<>(newSets.get(i).first, sumVal));\n                i = j;\n            }\n        }\n\n        int res = 0;\n        for (Pair<List<Integer>, Integer> np : sets) {\n            res = add(res, np.second);\n        }\n        System.out.println(res);\n    }\n\n    static boolean equalLists(List<Integer> list1, List<Integer> list2) {\n        if (list1.size() != list2.size()) return false;\n        for (int i = 0; i < list1.size(); i++) {\n            if (!list1.get(i).equals(list2.get(i))) return false;\n        }\n        return true;\n    }\n\n    static class Pair<T, U> {\n        T first;\n        U second;\n\n        Pair(T first, U second) {\n            this.first = first;\n            this.second = second;\n        }\n    }\n}\n</translated_code>\n<confidence>\n0.95\n</confidence>", "token_logprobs": [-8.380061626667157e-05, -2.9802276912960224e-06, -1.1920928244535389e-07, -0.0005573864909820259, -3.3854863431770355e-05, -0.1128484383225441, -0.3869035542011261, -0.002650797599926591, -3.266281055402942e-05, -6.282132380874828e-05, -0.0008174415561370552, -2.9682672902708873e-05, -1.1920922133867862e-06, -4.851700214203447e-05, -0.1269436925649643, -0.008642767556011677, -0.13968904316425323, -0.004134678281843662, -9.536697689327411e-06, -0.16023242473602295, -1.1920928244535389e-07, 0.0, 0.0, -6.9141146923357155e-06, 0.0, 0.0, -6.198863957251888e-06, 0.0, -7.152555099310121e-07, -8.344646857949556e-07, -2.3841855067985307e-07, -1.6689286894688848e-06, -0.04858846589922905, -0.08894675970077515, -5.245195097813848e-06, -0.3872358500957489, -0.0025557968765497208, -4.792098479811102e-05, -0.0018874465022236109, -1.0728830375228426e-06, -2.3841855067985307e-07, -2.3841855067985307e-07, -1.1920928244535389e-07, -1.7881233361549675e-05, -6.794906312279636e-06, -5.960462772236497e-07, -1.311301275563892e-06, -0.20143623650074005, -9.536738616588991e-07, -0.001334729720838368